# ANN–LSTM short-term forecast (feature/ann-lstm-forecast)
#
# Production assets in this folder:
#   - pinn_model_best.h5          PINN (maps / 168-h hourly)
#   - ann_lstm_L60_best.h5        ANN–LSTM (1/3/7-day from 60d SST+DHW)
#   - lstm_forecaster.py          LSTM runtime
#   - prepare_data.py             multi-site SST/DHW loader + scalers
#   - forecaster.py               PINN runtime
#   - sliot_dataset/              historical baselines + LSTM history
#
# Sync from model repo:
#   python sync_model_assets.py --source D:\corals\model
#
# API:
#   GET /api/lstm-forecast?location=hikkaduwa
#   GET /sensors/{id}/lstm-forecast

# Large training-only files (not needed at API runtime)
*.npy
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/
dataset/
pinn_model_saved/
*.png
coral_reef_risk_map.html
